              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jo a Reuben en ame bino bedo i te benderagi tuŋ anyarolum, kun oguro eryoŋet eryoŋet; atel a jo Reuben obedo Elijur wot a Cedeur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
